@*
    NEXUS brand lockup - logo mark at wwwroot/logo2.png plus the NEXUS wordmark.

    The logo is a blue symbol on a transparent background, so it sits on a white plate
    to stay legible against the navy navbar / sidebar / footer. Its proportions are
    preserved (height-driven, never stretched). If the asset is missing the plate is
    hidden and only the wordmark remains.
*@
<span class="brand-mark">
    <img src="~/logo2.png" alt="NEXUS logo" onerror="this.parentElement.style.display='none';" />
</span>
<span class="brand-word">NEXUS</span>
